From: windgodsnowdrink <windgodsnowdrink@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 14:38:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chore(scripts): add Windows fix for GitHub dev push abort

- add scripts/06-fix-github-dev-push.ps1: one-shot PowerShell fixer
  for the 'Software caused connection abort' fetch failure on Windows.
  Auto-detects local Clash/v2rayN proxy, writes repo-scoped
  http(s).proxy / HTTP/1.1 / postBuffer / GCM credential helper,
  probes GitHub via proxy CONNECT, then runs ls-remote / fetch /
  push dry-run verification; supports -Proxy / -SetPatRemote /
  -RemoveProxy flags.
- add scripts/README-github-dev-push-fix.txt: root cause, manual
  git config equivalents, and HTTPS vs SSH migration notes.
